  "boundaries": [
    "One allocation and one receipt per enrolled checkpoint log and verifier custody slot",
    "Keys generated in originating role directories; same-host administrator and no OS role isolation",
    "Fixture coordinator reads buyer and provider seeds for bilateral consent; context construction reads governance and status seeds together",
    "Provider funding and operator custody journals have no external rollback anchor",
    "Historical response replay does not refresh standing or authorize payment",
    "No external revocation feed; bounded local authority standing",
    "Python verifies execution authority and externally pinned allocation; it does not verify chain funding",
    "Same native receipt-store checkpoint signer rule; unchanged kernel and workspace dependencies"
